/** \file klip_algorithm.dox
 * \brief Developer guide to the KLIP algorithm implementation.
 * \author Jared R. Males
 */

/** \addtogroup developer_klip_algorithm
 * @{
 *
 * `klipReduce` owns application configuration and dispatch in `src/apps/klipReduce.cpp`. A normal reduction loads
 * the target and optional reference file lists, then calls \ref mx::improc::KLIPreduction::regions "KLIPreduction::regions()".
 *
 * \section developer_klip_flow Processing flow
 *
 * For each configured annular or wedge-shaped region, `KLIPreduction::regions()` constructs the pixel index, extracts
 * flattened target and reference data, applies the configured mean subtraction or normalization, and calls
 * \ref mx::improc::KLIPreduction::worker "KLIPreduction::worker()". The worker forms the reference covariance,
 * selects the allowed reference library for each target, calls `calcKLModesAdaptive()` for the required KL modes,
 * and projects and subtracts those modes from the target region. The production direct specialization fixes the
 * calculation scalar at FP32 and the eigensolver scalar at FP64. Exact factor deletion is a separate FP64 internal
 * path whose modes are cast back to FP32.
 *
 * When sparse PSF response measurement is enabled, \ref mx::improc::KLIPPSFModel "KLIPPSFModel" samples each
 * configured sky source in detector coordinates and applies the same supported linear regional centering. The live
 * target basis then evaluates direct-minus-projected probe residuals for every requested mode count. Each region is
 * accumulated through the production cubic derotation footprint directly into a compact per-frame stamp, avoiding
 * full detector response cubes. After all regions, the frame stamps are combined and
 * \ref mx::improc::RadialPSFModel "RadialPSFModel" rotates measurements to a common angle, averages within radius,
 * and supplies nearest-radius evaluation.
 *
 * The resulting regional residuals are scattered into the output cubes. Finally,
 * \ref mx::improc::KLIPreduction::finalProcess "KLIPreduction::finalProcess()" delegates post-median subtraction,
 * derotation, combination, and product writing to the shared
 * \ref mx::improc::ADIobservation::finalProcess "ADIobservation::finalProcess()" lifecycle.
 *
 * \section developer_klip_code_map Code map
 *
 * - `src/apps/klipReduce.cpp`: application configuration and dispatch.
 * - `src/common/KLIPreduction.hpp`: region orchestration, reference selection, PCA calculation, and final processing.
 * - `src/common/KLIPPSFModel.*`: sparse probe construction, frozen-basis projection, and compact derotation.
 * - `src/common/RadialPSFModel.*`: common-angle averaging and nearest-radius response evaluation.
 * - `src/common/KLIPreduction.cpp`: production template instantiation.
 *
 * @}
 */
